  "description": "Double Peak, a series inspired by a local spot not far from Haro utilizes a low stand over, low center of gravity designed frame made from 6000 series alloy, an internal head tube, and internal cable routing to keep things clean and tucked away. DP Sport features a 24speed drive train commanded by Shimano's Easy Fire 3x8 speed shifters. It rolls fast and launches over obstacles on its XM-2 29\" double wall rims, stainless spokes and finished with Kenda Honey badger 29\" x 2.2\" tires. The front end features a Suntour XCT 100mm fork and has a hydraulic lockout ready when desired. The Sport with its big wheels loves to go fast, but it can stop on a dime thanks to Shimano's M-315 Hydraulic disc brake set.",
